Runs the SAME vectors that pin the pure logic headlessly in CI
(tools/evaluator-kat.py, tools/betting-kat.py, tools/protocol-kat.py), so a
green run here plus green KATs there means the xTalk and the reference
implementations agree byte-for-byte on engine. Everything crypto-touching is
gated on SodiumXT and reports SKIP (not FAIL) when the extension is absent.

