    heRunSelftest

Family rules honored here: asserts are self-diagnosing (they print what was
OBSERVED, not just FAIL); kHeHarnessV below is printed in the report header
and MUST be bumped on every engine-behavior change so a stale paste
identifies itself.

Verified statically; needs an OXT pass.
*/

